WEBVTT

00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:15,140
I've been on your metastatic prostate cancer diet and supplement program as well as the

00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,540
RIFE Sheen for two years now.

00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:22,700
I did receive three injections of androgen deprivation drug and then stopped.

00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,380
It's been a year and a half since I stopped them.

00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:34,500
My monthly PSA results have been consistently less than 0.02.

00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:38,900
Should I continue the same protocol or should I get an updated plan for you?

00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:47,780
Well, if you're getting these results, if your last PSA was still in that range,

00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:50,780
to be honest, I wouldn't change a thing.

00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:53,620
So I don't think there's a need.

00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:58,340
So again, here's the real question, when should I do a cheek swab test?

00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,980
When should I do another cheek swab test?

00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:05,740
Well, when you just start with me, it can be good to do a cheek swab test within 60 days

00:01:05,740 --> 00:01:08,500
just to make sure we tweak things and we get things going.

00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:14,380
If you've been going with us for two years now and you're having wonderful benefits,

00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:21,540
it's like, would you run to the doctor and make a change to your lifestyle?

00:01:21,540 --> 00:01:22,620
You're doing well.

00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:25,820
So why would you make giant lifestyle changes?

00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:30,660
You don't necessarily want to make protocol changes if you're doing really well.

00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:32,940
So I'd say, stay the course.

